/*
 * KYJIT Sea of Nodes Compiler IR — v1.0.0
 *
 * Tri-edge node-based IR:
 *   - Value edges: data dependencies
 *   - Control edges: execution order
 *   - Effect edges: side effect ordering
 *
 * Foundation for optimization, scheduling, codegen.
 */

